SUMMARY:McGovern Centennial Gardens Volunteer Day
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Wednesday for hands-on gardening projects at the McGovern Centennial Gardens. From 8 a.m. to 11 a.m.\, come help with seasonal tasks like planting\, weeding\, mulching\, and pruning. A great way to connect with others and make a visible impact in the Park! \nNo experience needed. All ages are welcome. \nMeet at the Family Garden in McGovern Centennial Gardens. \n Click here to sign up!
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/mcgovern-centennial-gardens-volunteer-day-6/
LOCATION:McGovern Centennial Gardens\, 1500 Hermann Drive\, Houston\, TX\, 77004\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/mcg_aerial4-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
